  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Mark Pincus is an American billionaire who founded Zynga, the social games company. A Wharton graduate with a Harvard MBA, he previously built FreeLoader, Support.com and Tribe Networks. He later co-founded Reinvent Capital, investing in technology businesses after a career that combined company creation, early startup backing and consumer product development.",
    "html": "<p>Mark Pincus is an American billionaire who founded Zynga, the social games company. A Wharton graduate with a Harvard MBA, he previously built FreeLoader, Support.com and Tribe Networks. He later co-founded Reinvent Capital, investing in technology businesses after a career that combined company creation, early startup backing and consumer product development.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 52,
