  "long_biography": {
    "plain_text": "Game entrepreneur Mark Pincus tests demand before committing to elaborate products. At Zynga, his team placed a link to its poker game inside Mafia Wars. When players clicked, the team built a basic poker table, then spent a week improving it after the first version attracted interest.\n\nPincus applies a similarly deliberate process to his personal plans. Each year he writes in a notebook he calls his Book of Life, considering what his future self would appreciate him doing now. The practice began during a period of dissatisfaction with his career. He uses it to set commitments about his habits, relationships and work for the year ahead.",
    "html": "<p>Game entrepreneur Mark Pincus tests demand before committing to elaborate products. At Zynga, his team placed a link to its poker game inside Mafia Wars. When players clicked, the team built a basic poker table, then spent a week improving it after the first version attracted interest.</p>\r\n<p>Pincus applies a similarly deliberate process to his personal plans. Each year he writes in a notebook he calls his Book of Life, considering what his future self would appreciate him doing now. The practice began during a period of dissatisfaction with his career. He uses it to set commitments about his habits, relationships and work for the year ahead.</p>\r\n",
